[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 1500.23, "timestamp": "00:25:00", "text": "？ 除了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1506.789, "timestamp": "00:25:06", "text": "今年将要出现的漂亮模特之外，还有其他新东西吗？（音乐） 有什么计划吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1510.39, "timestamp": "00:25:10", "text": "有什么值得我们等待和期待的吗"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1511.75, "timestamp": "00:25:11", "text": "？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1514.87, "timestamp": "00:25:14", "text": "我还没做任何计划，但我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1525.19, "timestamp": "00:25:25", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1528.31, "timestamp": "00:25:28", "text": "希望一切顺利。 呃，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1530.549, "timestamp": "00:25:30", "text": "其实我是在数人数。 这虽然"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1533.43, "timestamp": "00:25:33", "text": "不是什么好事，但还是…… 我觉得"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1535.669, "timestamp": "00:25:35", "text": "我们可以一起开始玩《Among Us》以及所有相关的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1542.789, "timestamp": "00:25:42", "text": "我想我们的人手应该足够了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1545.99, "timestamp": "00:25:45", "text": "哦，《Among Us》。 我错过了那场比赛。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1547.772, "timestamp": "00:25:47", "text": "现在还有人玩吗？  [笑声]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1548.39, "timestamp": "00:25:48", "text": "[倒吸一口凉气] 是的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1552.47, "timestamp": "00:25:52", "text": "，在英国和美国，人们"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1554.789, "timestamp": "00:25:54", "text": "仍然对这种游戏抱有很大的宽容"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1556.07, "timestamp": "00:25:56", "text": "。   是的"}]